MMEEDDIIAA SSEELLEECCTTIIOONN
     The Realtek 8019 (ISA, ISAPnP, some PCMCIA) and Realtek 8029 (PCI)
     NE2000-compatible Ethernet chips include support for software media se‐
     lection.  If one of these chips is detected by the driver, the list of
     supported media will be displayed.

     For all other chips supported by the nnee driver, media selection must be
     performed either via card jumper settings or by vendor-supplied configu‐
     ration programs.

